# Terraform files must check out with LF.
#
# HCL heredocs preserve line endings verbatim, and two of these files render
# systemd units into cloud-init. With CRLF, the "\" line continuations are
# followed by a CR instead of ending the line, and the last argument of
# ExecStart picks up a trailing CR - so the unit silently fails to start its
# container. Same reasoning for the templates and the operator scripts.
*.tf      text eol=lf
*.tftpl   text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
